#. <CLT 4>これは…整理整頓とはかけ離れたロッカーだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This locker is totally disorganized.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、このロッカーの持ち主は、
#. 整理が苦手な人なんだろうな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whoever it belongs to probably has organization\n"
"problems in every part of their life...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 教科書やノートが、
#. 束になって放置されているけど…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's all kinds of textbooks and notebooks stacked\n"
"up in no particular order."
msgstr ""

#. 埃がたまってるぞ…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And dust everywhere..."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、この人…
#. あんまり勉強が得意じゃないんだろうな。
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I have to assume whoever's stuff this is didn't do a\n"
"lot of studying."
msgstr ""

#. …って、人の事は言えないか。
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Not that I can really talk."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ボクは何気なく…
#. 本当に何気なく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Trying to act as casual and natural as possible...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>１冊のノートを手にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I picked up one of the notebooks I saw.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、そのノートを見た瞬間…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But the moment I looked inside the notebook...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな“何気ない気持ち”は、
#. 一気に吹っ飛んでしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...any sense of easiness I may have had evaporated.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …え？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr "...Cái gì?"

#. <CLT 4>そのノートには、確かに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was no denying what I saw.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“葉隠康比呂”<CLT><CLT 4>と、そう書いてあった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Inside the notebook was written \"<CLT><CLT 3>Yasuhiro Hagakure<CLT><CLT 4>.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それって…あの葉隠クン…？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is this...*our* Yasuhiro?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、ノートには、何回分かの授業の内容が、
#. しっかりと書き留められている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The notebook also contained a large number of notes\n"
"for a variety of different classes.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…それって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ここで…授業を受けていた…？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He...attended classes here?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…そんなはずない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No...that can't be possible.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、葉隠クンはボクと一緒で、
#. この学園に来たばかりだったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, Hiro came to this school at the same time as\n"
"the rest of us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで、すぐに“これ”に巻き込まれて…
#. だから…授業どころか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And we were all sucked into this evil world. We never\n"
"had the chance to take any classes...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…このノートって…？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...what *is* this notebook?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ロッカールームで見つけたノート<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Locker Notebook<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このノートには“葉隠康比呂”と、
#. 確かに、そう書いてある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no denying that someone wrote the name\n"
"\"Yasuhiro Hagakure\" in this notebook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それって…あの葉隠クン…？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is that *our* Yasuhiro?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、このノートには、何回かの授業の内容が、
#. しっかりと書き留められている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The notebook also contained a large number of notes\n"
"for a variety of different classes.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…それって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which would mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ここでの授業を受けていた…？
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He...attended classes here?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…そんなはずない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No...that can't be possible.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、葉隠クンがこの学園に来たのは、
#. ボクと一緒の時だったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, Hiro came to this school at the same time as\n"
"the rest of us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら…このノートって…？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...what *is* this notebook?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…水晶玉か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is...a crystal ball.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ん？　水晶玉…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? A crystal ball...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いや、まさか…な…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No...it can't be..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“彼”<CLT><CLT 4>が、このロッカーを使ってたなんて…
#. そんな事ある訳ないんだ……<CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no way <CLT><CLT 3>he<CLT><CLT 4> ever used this locker. It's just\n"
"not possible...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…水晶玉か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a crystal ball.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. まさか…な…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But that...can't be..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“彼”<CLT><CLT 4>が、このロッカーを使っていたなんて…
#. そんな事ある訳ないんだし…<CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no way <CLT><CLT 3>he<CLT><CLT 4> ever used this locker. It's just\n"
"not possible...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、トランプ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this a deck of playing cards?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…じゃなくて、タロットカードか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No...they're tarot cards.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>え？　タロットカード…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...wait...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Nhưng... chờ đã..."

#. <CLT 4>それって…占いで使われる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Aren't those used for telling fortunes?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. たまたま…だよな？
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's...just a coincidence, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>タロットカードって…
#. 占いで使われる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Tarot cards are used to tell fortunes...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. たまたま…だよな？
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's...just a coincidence, right?"
msgstr ""
